  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41699668",
      "title": "Handling Keys Dynamically",
      "sourceHash": "5ab9e30197974a45888d6e48eff7f5fc2352fb6bd7bcb18ee0ad01f51d553496",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 5.28,
          "en": "Now kind of related to render props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.28,
          "end": 9.21,
          "en": "is another little improvement I wanna make here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.21,
          "end": 13.96,
          "en": "in this app, and that improvement is related to my key here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.88,
          "end": 17.64,
          "en": "because the problem with that key here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.64,
          "end": 22.02,
          "en": "in \"searchable list\" is that it's currently that index,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.02,
          "end": 23.94,
          "en": "and as you learned before in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.94,
          "end": 25.38,
          "en": "that's not a great key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.38,
          "end": 28.59,
          "en": "because it's not directly linked to the data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.59,
          "end": 31.08,
          "en": "Now, linking it to the data is difficult though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.08,
          "end": 34.86,
          "en": "because we, for example, can't use \"item ID\" as a key here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.86,
          "end": 36.93,
          "en": "because not all items we're passing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.93,
          "end": 40.17,
          "en": "to \"searchable list\" will have an ID property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.17,
          "end": 43.083,
          "en": "and not all items will be objects to begin with.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.58,
          "end": 47.61,
          "en": "For example, our strings here are not objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.61,
          "end": 52.61,
          "en": "and have no ID property therefore, so that won't work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.21,
          "end": 59.21,
          "en": "What we can do instead here is again work with props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 59.55,
          "end": 64.55,
          "en": "and expect to get a item key function prop, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 65.7,
          "end": 68.22,
          "en": "the name obviously, is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 68.22,
          "end": 73.11,
          "en": "and here, I expect this prop to get a function as a value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 73.11,
          "end": 76.203,
          "en": "which I can now call here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 77.43,
          "end": 81.06,
          "en": "hence the parentheses to dynamically generate a key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 81.06,
          "end": 82.833,
          "en": "for a specific item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 84.06,
          "end": 87.84,
          "en": "so I'll pass that item to that function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 87.84,
          "end": 90.78,
          "en": "and it's now the job of the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 90.78,
          "end": 94.89,
          "en": "that uses \"searchable list\" to provide a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 94.89,
          "end": 99.06,
          "en": "which will handle the item I'm giving to that function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 99.06,
          "end": 102.243,
          "en": "to return a unique key for every item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 104.00999999999999,
          "end": 106.8,
          "en": "So back in the \"app\" component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 106.8,
          "end": 109.22999999999999,
          "en": "on \"searchable list for places\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 109.22999999999999,
          "end": 111.6,
          "en": "we can set that item key function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 111.6,
          "end": 113.973,
          "en": "to a function that will receive the item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 114.9,
          "end": 118.047,
          "en": "and which in this case then, will return \"item ID\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 119.03999999999999,
          "end": 121.95,
          "en": "and we can do that for the other searchable list as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 121.95,
          "end": 126.42,
          "en": "but here, it's the item itself that should act as a key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 126.42,
          "end": 130.2,
          "en": "and this now extends that render props pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 130.2,
          "end": 134.55,
          "en": "for this specific use case here by passing another function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 134.55,
          "end": 136.803,
          "en": "to that searchable list component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 138.06,
          "end": 140.73,
          "en": "Now a function that will not be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 140.73,
          "end": 142.92000000000002,
          "en": "to render some JSX code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 142.92000000000002,
          "end": 146.613,
          "en": "but instead a function that's needed to get a unique key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 148.32,
          "end": 150.87,
          "en": "With that all, if you save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 150.87,
          "end": 153.42000000000002,
          "en": "you'll see that we got no errors here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 153.42000000000002,
          "end": 156.32999999999998,
          "en": "and of course, the app still works as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 156.32999999999998,
          "end": 160.893,
          "en": "but now with render props and this additional key function.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
